abstract: >-
  Reproducibility inputs, expected outputs, scripts, figures, and supplementary
  tables for the OX4 transcript-score association analysis in public colorectal
  cancer cohorts. The package preserves the analysis and its interpretation
  boundaries; it does not establish a functional assay for oxeiptosis.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22882797"
